# Who handles what

{manager} looks after work priorities and chairs the planning review. {platform} runs the platform side: the drive, the decision gateway, the assistant runtime and the inbox tooling. {planner} keeps the planning and programme records and sends most requests to the assistant. {finance} handles budgets, invoices and supplier records. {extra1} supports {planner} on programme delivery, {extra2} handles external communications, and {extra3} looks after the building.

{mission_note}

